coder v0.0.0-devel

USAGE:
  coder exit-node create [flags] <name>

  Create an exit node and print its token

OPTIONS:
  -O, --org string, $CODER_ORGANIZATION
          Select which organization (uuid or name) to use.

      --display-name string
          Display name of the exit node. Defaults to the name.

      --only-token bool
          Only print the token. This is useful for scripting.

———
Run `coder --help` for a list of global options.
